  "body_html": "<h1>Binary Knapsack Allocations</h1>\n<p>The binary-allocation layer represents selected agents by Boolean profiles,\nconverts them into real allocation vectors, and defines finite feasible\nknapsack search spaces with a social-welfare objective.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[EconCSLib PR #27, blueprint/src/content.tex, def:auction_knapsack_binary] EconCSLib pull request #27, https://github.com/gametheoryinlean/EconCSLib/pull/27. Migrated from the PR's old leanblueprint section into mdblueprint staged form.</li>\n</ul>",
